<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /><verse style="v" number="36" sid="DAN 4:36" />At that time my understanding returns to me, and for the glory of my kingdom, my honor and my brightness return to me, and to me my counselors and my great men seek, and over my kingdom I have been made right, and abundant greatness has been added to me.
